    <!--
      The themed-icon layer: the same artwork as ic_launcher_foreground.xml as one flat silhouette.
      Android tints a monochrome layer using only its alpha, so colour does nothing here - detail is
      kept by cutting it out instead: each cube's faces are parted by thin gaps with pips as holes in
      them, the cup's band is a hole in its body, and the cup's mouth is an open ellipse outlined by its
      rim. The 0.8 zoom is copied from the foreground, so keep the two in step when one changes. The
      cubes are generated with the foreground's by scripts/generate-launcher-dice.py: change them there.
    -->
